#!/usr/bin/env -S conda run --no-capture-output -n ecs python
"""Direct single-process replay of the captured 170-call CUDA pinv sequence.

Run from anywhere with ``/home/cx/AI_QEC/AI_QEC/test_170``.  The default
execution is CUDA and uses the exact manifest and retained GA/GB snapshots
that back the Spark/local differential diagnostic.  This direct variant has
no SSH transport, controller process, or acknowledgement round-trip.

This is a workload-reproduction tool, not simulator release evidence and not
a hardware-health certification.  The matrices for each call are top-left
principal submatrices of the retained largest side-specific snapshots; they
are not claimed to be every exact historical tensor.
"""

